# Local Plan Storage

- When creating a plan, store it in `./.cursor/plans/` for this repository.
- If the plan is initially created in the global Cursor plans directory, immediately copy it to `./.cursor/plans/` and continue using the local copy.
- Prefer filenames like `<topic>_<id>.plan.md` and keep plan files in version-control-friendly markdown.
